     "up": {"title":"Name that trend (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Nine examples, four options each, and some of the options are close. Identify the emerging trend each example shows most clearly.</p>","items":[{"text":"Viewers of a St. Lucian jewellery maker's live broadcast tap \"buy\" while she models each piece.","options":["Subscriptions","Short-form video","Influencer marketing","Live commerce"],"answer":3,"fb":"Buying in real time during a broadcast is live commerce."},{"text":"Fans of a Jamaican musician pay US$5 a month for early releases and behind-the-scenes clips.","options":["Podcasting","Live commerce","Influencer marketing","Subscriptions and direct fan support"],"answer":3,"fb":"A paid monthly membership is a subscription: direct fan support."},{"text":"Tourists point their phones at Fort Charlotte in St. Vincent and see soldiers from the 1800s on screen, standing on the real walls.","options":["Virtual reality","Automation","Generative AI","Augmented reality"],"answer":3,"fb":"Digital images laid over the real place: augmented reality. In VR, the real world would be hidden."},{"text":"A headset takes users inside a full 3D reconstruction of a Kalinago village, and they cannot see the room around them.","options":["Augmented reality","Live streaming","Short-form video","Virtual reality"],"answer":3,"fb":"A fully digital world that replaces the real surroundings is virtual reality."},{"text":"A radio station in Antigua films its morning talk show and uploads full episodes to a video platform.","options":["Podcasting and audio growth (including video podcasts)","Live streaming","Short-form video","Automation"],"answer":0,"fb":"Recorded talk shows released as video episodes are part of the growth of podcasts and video podcasts."},{"text":"A tool posts a creator's clips automatically at the times her audience is most active.","options":["Influencer marketing","Generative AI","Automation","Live commerce"],"answer":2,"fb":"Software carrying out a routine task such as scheduling is automation."},{"text":"A brand gives a Barbadian creator a fee and free products to review in her videos.","options":["Subscriptions","Live commerce","Influencer and creator marketing","Generative AI"],"answer":2,"fb":"Paying a creator to feature a product is influencer and creator marketing."},{"text":"A tool produces a full storyboard of new images from a one-paragraph description of a scene.","options":["Augmented reality","Automation","Generative AI","Short-form video"],"answer":2,"fb":"Creating new content from a prompt is generative AI; automation repeats routine tasks rather than creating new material."},{"text":"Expanded 5G coverage in Port of Spain lets fans watch a match in HD on their phones without buffering.","options":["Augmented reality","Live commerce","Automation","Faster networks (5G and fibre)"],"answer":3,"fb":"Higher-quality mobile streaming made possible by 5G is the faster-networks trend."}],"win":"Excellent. You told apart trends that look alike, such as AR and VR, or automation and generative AI."}
