     "up": {"title":"Which group of elements? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Now use all four groups from the notes. Some cards describe players that are easy to misplace, such as active audiences and clients. Sort each one.</p>","main":"Which of the four groups does this element belong to?","bins":["Creators and producers","Platforms, distributors and infrastructure","Audiences, clients and advertisers","Support and governance"],"items":[{"t":"A data protection commissioner investigating a leak of subscriber details","bin":3,"fb":"Setting and enforcing rules: a regulator."},{"t":"Contentful, used by a news site to organise and publish its stories","bin":3,"fb":"Organising and publishing content: a content management system."},{"t":"A government ministry that hires an agency to make a road-safety campaign","bin":2,"fb":"An organisation commissioning digital media work: a client."},{"t":"A billing service that charges viewers every month","bin":3,"fb":"Enabling commerce: a payment system."},{"t":"A drinks brand buying targeted ads aimed at 18 to 30-year-olds","bin":2,"fb":"Paying for audience attention: an advertiser."},{"t":"A dashboard that reports which thumbnails get the most clicks","bin":3,"fb":"Measuring content performance: an analytics system."},{"t":"A Kittitian vlogger who films and uploads her own island-hopping videos","bin":0,"fb":"An individual making original content: a creator."},{"t":"A telecom company laying fibre to new housing areas","bin":1,"fb":"The backbone that keeps everything running: an infrastructure provider."},{"t":"A content delivery network that stores copies of videos close to viewers in the region","bin":1,"fb":"Delivering content through networks: a distributor."},{"t":"Fans who remix a song and post their own versions","bin":2,"fb":"Audiences are active participants who share and co-create."},{"t":"A studio that finances and packages a branded campaign for a bank","bin":0,"fb":"Developing, packaging and financing at scale: a producer."},{"t":"An app store where users find and download a local game","bin":1,"fb":"Where content is hosted and discovered: a platform."}],"win":"Excellent. You placed all twelve kinds of element in the four groups from the notes, including the ones that are easy to misplace."}
