     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">The Grenadian creator Shanice Joseph runs \"Spice Kitchen\", a cooking channel. She films on her phone, edits in a cloud-based app, uploads to a video platform and earns money from ads and a sponsorship with a local spice company. Her viewers are in Grenada and the diaspora in London and Toronto. A national authority is drafting new rules on online advertising to children.</p>",
