     "up": {"title":"Advantage or disadvantage? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Go beyond \"advantage or disadvantage\". Name the <b>specific</b> advantage or disadvantage of modern work models that each case shows, using the table on the workplace screen.</p>","items":[{"text":"A Dominican editor answers client messages at 11 p.m. every night and starts to feel burnt out.","options":["Flexible hours","Lower office and travel costs","Isolation and blurred work-life boundaries","Faster collaboration"],"answer":2,"fb":"Work spilling into the night is the blurred-boundaries disadvantage."},{"text":"A studio in Belize hires a sound designer in Ghana for one project.","options":["Irregular income and few benefits","Dependence on reliable internet and power","Access to global clients and talent","Data security risks"],"answer":2,"fb":"Hiring from another continent is access to global talent."},{"text":"A freelancer in Grenada earns US$3,000 in March but only US$400 in April.","options":["Irregular income and few benefits","Lower office and travel costs","Faster collaboration","Flexible hours"],"answer":0,"fb":"Uneven months are the irregular-income disadvantage of freelance and gig work."},{"text":"A team's shared drive is hacked and a client's unreleased campaign leaks.","options":["Access to global clients and talent","Flexible hours","Faster collaboration","Data security risks"],"answer":3,"fb":"Cloud tools that make sharing easy also create data security risks."},{"text":"A Jamaican agency gives up its rented office and saves J$400,000 a month.","options":["Dependence on reliable internet and power","Isolation and blurred work-life boundaries","Lower office and travel costs","Irregular income and few benefits"],"answer":2,"fb":"Saving rent is the lower-costs advantage."},{"text":"A client in Vancouver can only meet at 7 p.m. Antigua time, after the designer's working day.","options":["Lower office and travel costs","Faster collaboration","Access to global clients and talent","Time-zone difficulties"],"answer":3,"fb":"Working across continents brings time-zone difficulties."},{"text":"Editors in three islands finish a cut in two days by commenting on the same timeline online.","options":["Isolation and blurred work-life boundaries","Data security risks","Faster collaboration","Irregular income and few benefits"],"answer":2,"fb":"Working on one shared file at once is faster collaboration."},{"text":"A parent in St. Kitts edits during school hours and stops when her children come home.","options":["Dependence on reliable internet and power","Data security risks","Flexible hours","Isolation and blurred work-life boundaries"],"answer":2,"fb":"Choosing her own working hours is the flexibility advantage."},{"text":"A storm knocks out power in Tobago the night before a remote delivery deadline.","options":["Faster collaboration","Time-zone difficulties","Dependence on reliable internet and power","Flexible hours"],"answer":2,"fb":"Remote work stops when power or internet fails."}],"win":"Well done. You named the precise advantage or disadvantage in each case, which is the detail an evaluation answer needs."}
