     "up": {"title":"Which skill group? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>The skills are not named this time. Each case shows a skill in action: work out the skill, then its group in the notes.</p>","items":[{"text":"Kezia films three possible opening shots, then rejects two after judging which best fits the brief.","options":["Digital and research","Core professional","Entrepreneurial"],"answer":1,"fb":"Generating options and judging them is creativity and critical thinking: core professional."},{"text":"Andre learns a new cloud editing app in one day when his client switches tools.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":2,"fb":"Learning new tools quickly is digital literacy."},{"text":"Simone plans every task on a timeline and keeps the documentary within budget.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":2,"fb":"Delivering on time and within budget is project management, grouped with digital and research skills."},{"text":"Marlon presents a two-minute pitch to a hotel board and wins the contract.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Digital and research","Core professional"],"answer":0,"fb":"Presenting ideas persuasively is branding and pitching: entrepreneurial."},{"text":"Tasha keeps in touch with three producers she met at the Trinidad and Tobago Film Festival.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":0,"fb":"Maintaining professional relationships is networking: entrepreneurial."},{"text":"Joel explains a complex idea clearly to a team spread across three islands, and the team agrees a plan.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":1,"fb":"Communication and collaboration: core professional."},{"text":"Aisha prices each illustration to cover materials, time and a profit margin.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":0,"fb":"Pricing and budgeting are financial literacy: entrepreneurial."},{"text":"Leon checks a statistic against two credible sources before using it in a documentary.","options":["Core professional","Entrepreneurial","Digital and research"],"answer":2,"fb":"Evaluating sources is research."},{"text":"When a location falls through on shoot day, Kayla moves the scene indoors and keeps filming.","options":["Entrepreneurial","Core professional","Digital and research"],"answer":1,"fb":"Pivoting when needed is problem-solving and adaptability: core professional."}],"win":"Well done. You identified each skill from what the person did and placed it in the right group."}
