     "up": {"title":"Challenge or opportunity? (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","intro":"<p>Judge each statement from the point of view of a music video studio in Bridgetown, Barbados. Think about how it affects THIS business, then sort it.</p>","main":"For the Bridgetown studio, is this mainly a challenge or an opportunity?","bins":["Challenge","Opportunity"],"items":[{"t":"Diaspora Crop Over events in London and Toronto want live streams from Barbados.","bin":1,"fb":"Diaspora outreach is a growing opportunity."},{"t":"Talented editors leave to study abroad and do not return.","bin":0,"fb":"A training gap and loss of talent limits the studio's growth."},{"t":"AI tools let overseas competitors produce music videos at a fraction of the cost.","bin":0,"fb":"A global trend that increases price competition."},{"t":"Regional investors see creative businesses as high risk.","bin":0,"fb":"Limited funding is a regional challenge."},{"t":"Global streaming platforms now recommend dancehall and soca to listeners worldwide.","bin":1,"fb":"Wider target markets for Caribbean music create demand for music videos."},{"t":"Many rural fans cannot stream HD video on their data plans.","bin":0,"fb":"The digital divide limits the audience the studio's clients can reach."},{"t":"Hotels compete for influencer content to attract visitors in the off-season.","bin":1,"fb":"Tourism marketing drives demand for video content."},{"t":"An advert approved in Barbados breaks advertising rules in another market where the video is shown.","bin":0,"fb":"Cross-border regulation adds risk and cost when content travels."},{"t":"Regional mobile wallets now let diaspora fans pay creators directly.","bin":1,"fb":"Better payment access opens diaspora income."},{"t":"Ministries want public health videos with local voices and languages.","bin":1,"fb":"Public service communication suits local creators' authentic voice."}],"win":"Well judged. You assessed each point for a specific business, which is the first step from listing to evaluating."}
