     "up": {"title":"Which section does it belong in? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>All eleven sections this time, from the proposal \"MoBay Safe Seas\", a water-safety video campaign. Some extracts sound alike (executive summary and conclusion; problem statement and background), so read closely.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"\"MoBay Safe Seas: a water-safety video campaign. Prepared by Lower Six Digital Media, Hummingbird Ridge High School, 20 October 2026.\"","r":"Title page"},{"l":"\"This proposal requests USD 1,100 to produce six safety videos that will reach 50,000 beach visitors by April.\"","r":"Executive summary"},{"l":"\"Jamaica welcomes over a million cruise visitors a year, and its beaches are central to that trade.\"","r":"Introduction and background"},{"l":"\"Three drowning incidents involving visitors were reported last season, and few visitors notice the safety signs.\"","r":"Problem statement"},{"l":"\"Reach 50,000 views by 30 April and raise correct answers on a beach-safety quiz from 40% to 70%.\"","r":"Objectives"},{"l":"\"Week 1: storyboard. Week 2: film at Doctor's Cave and Cornwall Beach. Week 3: edit and caption.\"","r":"Plan of action"},{"l":"\"Equipment hire: USD 400; captions and translation: USD 150; contingency (10%): USD 55.\"","r":"Budget"},{"l":"\"Visitors stay safer, lifeguards answer fewer basic questions, and the sponsor reaches 50,000 potential customers.\"","r":"Benefits"},{"l":"\"We will compare quiz results from 100 visitors before and after the campaign.\"","r":"Evaluation"},{"l":"\"Safer beaches protect lives and the island's reputation. We ask the Tourist Bureau to fund this campaign.\"","r":"Conclusion"},{"l":"\"Quiz questions, storyboards and a quotation from the equipment rental company.\"","r":"Appendices"}],"win":"Excellent. You placed every extract, including the close pairs: the summary previews the whole proposal, while the conclusion restates the need and makes the request."}
