     "up": {"title":"Strong or weak? (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","intro":"<p>Go further than \"strong or weak\": diagnose exactly what is wrong, or recognise when the writing is already strong. All extracts come from a proposal for the Paws Haven animal shelter.</p>","items":[{"text":"Objective: \"Increase followers on the shelter's page by 40%.\"","options":["Weak: describes the problem","Strong (SMART)","Weak: no deadline","Weak: not measurable"],"answer":2,"fb":"It is measurable, but it has no date, so it is not time-bound."},{"text":"Objective: \"By 31 March, help more people care about animals.\"","options":["Strong (SMART)","Weak: not measurable","Weak: no deadline","Weak: not achievable"],"answer":1,"fb":"\"Care more\" cannot be measured. Name a number, such as enquiries or adoptions."},{"text":"Problem statement: \"In 2026 the shelter averaged three adoptions a month from 45 dogs, and its page has no videos.\"","options":["Weak: too vague","Strong","Weak: no evidence","Weak: describes a solution"],"answer":1,"fb":"Specific evidence, a clear need and no solution mentioned."},{"text":"Problem statement: \"The shelter needs a TikTok account.\"","options":["Strong","Weak: no evidence","Weak: too long","Weak: describes a solution"],"answer":3,"fb":"A TikTok account is a solution. The problem is too few adoptions and poor visibility."},{"text":"Evaluation: \"We will see if people like the videos.\"","options":["Weak: no measure or target","Weak: too long","Strong","Weak: belongs in the budget"],"answer":0,"fb":"Name the measure and target, such as adoptions per month before and after."},{"text":"Evaluation: \"We will compare monthly adoptions in January and April, and survey 50 adopters about how they found their dog.\"","options":["Strong","Weak: belongs in the appendices","Weak: no measure or target","Weak: not linked to the objectives"],"answer":0,"fb":"Clear measures that test the adoption objective directly."},{"text":"Benefits: \"The sponsor's logo will appear in 30 videos, seen by an estimated 40,000 local viewers.\"","options":["Weak: not specific","Strong","Weak: belongs in the appendices","Weak: only benefits the team"],"answer":1,"fb":"A specific benefit to the funder, which helps secure the sponsorship."},{"text":"Executive summary: \"This document is about our project. Please read on to find out more.\"","options":["Weak: belongs at the end","Strong","Weak: too long","Weak: gives no overview"],"answer":3,"fb":"An executive summary must summarise the problem, solution, objectives, budget and benefit."},{"text":"Objective: \"By 30 April, post profiles of 30 dogs and raise adoptions from three to eight a month.\"","options":["Weak: no deadline","Weak: not measurable","Strong (SMART)","Weak: not achievable"],"answer":2,"fb":"Specific, measurable, realistic for the resources, relevant and time-bound."}],"win":"Excellent diagnosis. You can say precisely why a piece of proposal writing is weak, which is how you improve your own drafts."}
