     "type": "write",
     "title": "Short answer: title page and executive summary",
     "genre": "Structured response (6 marks): project proposal elements",
     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">Your Lower Six group plans \"Taste of the Friendly Island\", a series of short recipe videos with Sint Maarten home cooks, to be shared on social media and the island's tourism pages. Budget: USD 900. Timeline: eight weeks. Target audience: visitors planning a trip, and residents aged 16 to 35.</p>",
     "prompt": "<p>Using the notes on Group 01:</p><ol><li>List the information that should appear on the <b>title page</b>. (2 marks)</li><li>Write an <b>executive summary</b> of no more than 120 words for the project, giving a concise overview of the entire proposal: the problem, the solution, the objectives, the budget and the expected benefit. (4 marks)</li></ol>",
     "min": 90,
     "max": 200,
