     "up": {"title":"Which of the 4Ps? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>These decisions are harder to classify. Pricing models, distribution points and product features can look alike, so ask which question each decision answers: what, how much, where, or how people hear about it?</p>","items":[{"text":"The app is free for users, while vendors pay USD 15 a month for a premium listing.","options":["Place","Promotion","Price","Product"],"answer":2,"fb":"A two-sided pricing model: price."},{"text":"QR codes at the cruise pier let visitors download the app as they arrive.","options":["Product","Price","Promotion","Place"],"answer":3,"fb":"Where customers get the product: place. The notes list the pier QR codes under place."},{"text":"Local creators post short videos of themselves using the app at lolos.","options":["Place","Promotion","Product","Price"],"answer":1,"fb":"How people hear about it: promotion."},{"text":"The app adds a \"today's specials\" feature that vendors update each morning.","options":["Place","Product","Price","Promotion"],"answer":1,"fb":"A feature of what is offered: product."},{"text":"Episodes are released on major podcast platforms and embedded on the school website.","options":["Product","Place","Promotion","Price"],"answer":1,"fb":"The channels of distribution: place."},{"text":"The game has a free version with adverts and a USD 2 version with no adverts.","options":["Product","Place","Price","Promotion"],"answer":2,"fb":"A freemium pricing model: price."},{"text":"A countdown campaign runs on short-form video apps before launch.","options":["Place","Promotion","Product","Price"],"answer":1,"fb":"Building awareness: promotion."},{"text":"Transcripts are added to every episode so that schools can use them in class.","options":["Price","Place","Product","Promotion"],"answer":2,"fb":"Part of what is offered: product."},{"text":"The series is also distributed through a regional telecom's entertainment app.","options":["Place","Price","Product","Promotion"],"answer":0,"fb":"Another channel of distribution: place."}],"win":"Well done. You classified each decision by the question it answers, which is how to keep the 4Ps distinct in a pitch."}
